# long: two lanes of the full 1,048,576-token window. KV 36.28 GiB, docs/FIT.md "Profiles".
# Measured 2026-11-23 on engine 918e685 (SPEC=none), node-4, boot-only (VISION=on, PREFIX_CACHE=off, one 277K prefill): record bench/records/2026-11-23-profile-long (MemAvailable at ready 58.8 GiB, guard minimum 58.69 GiB). The 1M window with two lanes is covered by profile-max; 1M requests need --request-timeout 14400 (and the prefill/decision/queue timeouts) on builds before 1d53344.
PROFILE_MEASURED=1
MAX_MODEL_LEN=1048576
SLOTS=2
